RMB </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.11" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib81" title="" class="ltx_ref">81</a><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.12" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">]</span></cite><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.13" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">,
PPE </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.14" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib82" title="" class="ltx_ref">82</a><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.15" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">]</span></cite><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.16" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">,
RAG-RewardBench </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.17" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib83" title="" class="ltx_ref">83</a><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.18" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">]</span></cite><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.19" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">,
AceMath-RewardBench </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.20" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib84" title="" class="ltx_ref">84</a><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.21" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">]</span></cite><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.22" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">,
M-RewardBench </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.23" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib85" title="" class="ltx_ref">85</a><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.24" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">]</span></cite><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.25" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">,
RewardBench 2 </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.26" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib86" title="" class="ltx_ref">86</a><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.27" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">]</span></cite><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.28" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">,
RABench </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.29" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib87" title="" class="ltx_ref">87</a><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.30" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">]</span></cite><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.31" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">,
LCB-RB </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.32" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib88" title="" class="ltx_ref">88</a><span id="S2.T1.5.2.2.1.1.33" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">]</span></cite></span>
</span></td></tr>
